  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n- {停電|ていでん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (there is a power outage)\n- {停電|ていでん}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧ (to become a blackout, for power to go out)\n- {停電|ていでん}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{復旧|ふっきゅう}→復旧：07521_fukkyuu⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (power is restored)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{計画|けいかく}→計画：01172_keikaku⟧{停電|ていでん} (planned power outage, rolling blackout)\n- ⟦{大規模|だいきぼ}→大規模：12185_daikibo⟧{停電|ていでん} (large-scale blackout)\n- ⟦{復旧|ふっきゅう}→復旧：07521_fukkyuu⟧ (restoration, recovery)\n\nUSAGE:\nIn Japan, ⟦{計画|けいかく}→計画：01172_keikaku⟧{停電|ていでん} (planned power outages) were implemented after the 2011 earthquake to manage electricity shortages.",
